# qmldir — explicit module manifest for quickshell/modules/centre/ (Phase
# 19 Plan 06, D-19-14, QNOTIF-06). Mirrors every sibling module manifest's
# own standing instruction: any .qml type added to this directory that is
# NOT declared below becomes unresolvable to importers of
# `qs.modules.centre`. Any FUTURE type added to this directory MUST do the
# same, in the same commit that creates it.
#
# None of the three types below is a singleton. `NotifCentre` is the third
# top-level frame in this shell (after `PanelDialog`/`SectionPopout`,
# D-19-14's own "costly reversibility" record) — one ordinary instance,
# mounted once at shell.qml's root, exactly like `NotifPopupStack`/`Toast`.
# `NotifGroup` is one instance per app-group ListView delegate; `CentreFooter`
# is one instance, nested inside `NotifCentre`'s own pinned footer band.
module qs.modules.centre
NotifCentre 1.0 NotifCentre.qml
NotifGroup 1.0 NotifGroup.qml
CentreFooter 1.0 CentreFooter.qml
